+# Apply V44.3.0
+Apply the patch contents over a clean V43.20.0 repository, restart Node, then open `http://localhost:8787/?pack=aip`.
+
+Recommended order: AIP Capability Registry → Natural-Language Automation Compiler → Governed Execution Sandbox → AIP Runtime Readiness.
