+# Blue Current V44.3.0 — AIP Runtime Foundation
+
+## V44.0 AIP Capability Registry
+Registers governed Blue Current capabilities with risk, mode, endpoint, and approval metadata.
+
+## V44.1 Natural-Language Automation Compiler
+Compiles operator instructions into draft capability graphs without executing live changes.
+
+## V44.2 Governed Execution Sandbox
+Rehearses compiled automation plans and holds approval-gated steps while keeping live restaurant state unchanged.
+
+## V44.3 AIP Runtime Readiness
+Certifies the first V44 runtime path across V43 closure, capability registration, compiled automations, sandbox evidence, and no-auto-execution controls.
